{title: Bulla Ki Jana}
{artist: Rabbi Shergill}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm] [F#m] [G] [B]
[Bm]Bulla ki [F#m]jaana maen [G]kaun,        [Bm]Bulla ki [F#m]jaana maen [G]kaun
[Bm]Bulla ki [F#m]jaana maen [G]kaun,        [Bm]Bulla ki [F#m]jaana maen [G]kaun
[D]Na maen momin vich maseet aan,        [A]Na maen vich kufar diyan reet aan
[G]Na maen paakaan vich [A]paleet aan,        [D]Na maen andar ved kitaab aan,
[A]Na vich bhangaan na sharaab aan,        [G]Na vich rindaan masat kharaab aan [A]
[D]Na vich shaadi na ghamnaaki,        [A]Na maen vich paleeti paaki
[G]Na maen aabi na maen khaki [A],        [D]Na [A]maen aatish [C]na maen [F#]paun
[D]Na maen arabi na lahori,        [A]Na maen hindi shehar nagauri
[G]Na hindu na turak peshawri [A],        [D]Na maen bheth mazhab da paaya
[A]Ne maen aadam havva jaaya,        [G]Na maen apna naam [A]dharaaya
[D]Avval aakhir aap nu jaana,        [A]Na koi dooja hor pehchaana
[G]Maethon hor na koi siyaana,        [D]Bulla! [A]ooh [C]khadda hai [F#]kaun
[D]Na main moosa, na ph [A]aroah,        [D]Na main jagan, na vich [A]soudn.
[G]Na main atish, na main paudn,        [C]Na main rahnda, wich nadaun,
[C]Na main baitthan, na vich [G]bhaun.        [D]Bulle [A]Shah, [C]kharha hai [F#]kaun
